### get all Events (de todos los lugares)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/event

### get all Events of a Venue
GET http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event

### get one Event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event/1

### create a new Event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rock en el Teatro",
    "description": "Concierto de rock",
    "coverImage": "https://example.com/cover.jpg",
    "date": "2026-09-12",
    "startTime": "21:00:00",
    "endTime": "23:30:00",
    "organizer": 3,
    "ticketTypes": [1, 2]
}

### update an Event (PUT - full, idempotent resource)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rock en el Teatro",
    "description": "Concierto de rock (reprogramado)",
    "coverImage": "https://example.com/cover.jpg",
    "date": "2026-09-19",
    "startTime": "21:00:00",
    "endTime": "23:30:00",
    "organizer": 1
}

### update an Event (PATCH - partial resource)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endTime": "23:45:00"
}

### anular un Event (pasa a Cancelado, conserva sus entradas)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event/1/cancel

### delete an Event
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/venue/1/event/1
